  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "46",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 46"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "46",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wä I-thɛ-rɛl rööl I-jëp kɛnɛ ji̱ dhɔaarɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ cu I-thɛ-rɛl cu ɣöth jɛn kɛnɛ ji̱ dhɔaarɛ diaal amäni pe̱k kuaknikɛ diaal. Kä mëë cɛ cop kä Ber-cɛ-ba cuɛ Kuoth in la Kuoth gua̱n ni Ay-dhɛk thöp muc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ cu Kuoth ɛ la̱a̱k kɛ wäär cɔɔlɛ jɛ i̱, “Je-kɔb! Je-kɔb!” Kä cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ɣän ɛn.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth ɛ ku jiök i̱, “Ɛ ɣän Kuoth in la Kuoth guur. /Cu dual kɛ wädu ro̱o̱l I-jëp, kɛ ɣöö ɣän bä te kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ kä bä kuayku wä jak kä do̱r mi di̱i̱t ɛn wi̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän puɔ̱nydä bä kɛ lɛni nööŋ jɔk. Kä bi Jo-thɛp thiëëk kɛ ji̱ kɛ cäŋ liethdu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛ nɔ, mëë jiɛc Je-kɔb ni kä Ber-cɛ-ba wädɛ ro̱o̱l I-jëp, cu gaatkɛ jɛ jak kä ko̱tdɛ kɛɛl kɛnɛ ji̱ dho̱rikiɛn rɛy thurbiɛɛli tin ci Pɛro kɛ ka̱m kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ ɣöth kɛ ɣɔ̱kiɛn kɛɛl kɛ kuakiɛn diaal tëë ci kɛn kɛ duɔ̱l rɔ̱ ro̱o̱l Kɛ-naan, a wäkɛ ro̱o̱l I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛ nɔ, Je-kɔb cuɛ kuaykɛ diaal naŋ ro̱o̱l I-jëp, ti̱ti̱ kɛ gaatkɛ kɛ nyieekɛ kɛnɛ gaatdöödɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn ciööt kuayni I-thɛ-rɛl tëë cɛ naŋ ro̱o̱l I-jëp. Mɛmɛ ɛ Rɛ-u-ben in la gatdɛ min kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rɛ-u-ben cuɛ la gua̱n Ä-nok kɛnɛ Palu, kɛ Ɣɛdh-ron kɛnɛ Kar-mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gatdɛ min cɔal i̱ Cim-on a gua̱n Yɛ-muel, kɛ Ya-min kɛ O-adh, Ya-kin kɛ Dho-ɣar kɛ Ca-ul min man mɔ nya rööl Kɛ-naan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gatdɛ ni Lii-bay a gua̱n Ger-con, kɛ Kɛ-ɣath kɛnɛ Mɛ-ra-ri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gatdɛ ni Juda a gua̱n Ër, kɛ O-nan kɛ Cɛla kɛ Pɛ-rɛdh kɛnɛ Dhɛra, kuɛɛ la ɣöö cu Ër kɛnɛ O-nan li̱w ni ro̱o̱l Kɛ-naan. Kä gat döödɛ ni Pɛ-rɛdh min mɔ gat gatdɛ ni Juda, jɛn cuɛ la gua̱n Ɣɛdh-ron kɛnɛ A-mul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gatdɛ ni Yi-tha-kar cuɛ la gua̱n Tolä kɛnɛ Pö-wa, kɛ Ya-cub kɛnɛ Cim-rɔn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gatdɛ ni Dhɛ-bu-lun a gua̱n Thɛ-rɛd kɛ Ee-lon kɛnɛ Ya-leel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tɔ̱tɔ̱ kɛ kɛn gaat tëë ci Je-kɔb kɛnɛ ciekdɛ ni Leya kɛ di̱eth rɔ̱ dhɔɔr in cɔal i̱ Pa-dan-a-ram. Tekɛ kɛ nyaadiɛn mi cɔal i̱ Dina. Ɛ jɛ nɔ, pe̱k kuayni Je-kɔb kamädiɛn kɛnɛ Leya matdiɛn dhɔɔl kɛnɛ nyi̱er kɛɛl cukɛ a nɛy ti jiɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gatdɛ ni Gad a gua̱n Dhi-piɔn, kɛ Agi, kɛ Cuni, kɛ Ɛdh-bɔn, kɛ Eri, kɛ Ä-ro-di kɛnɛ A-re-li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gatdɛ ni A-cɛr a gua̱n Yim-naa, kɛ Ic-waa, kɛ Ic-wi, kɛ Bɛ-ri-ya kɛ nyimandiɛn kɛɛl ni Thɛra. Kä cu gat döödɛ ni Bɛ-ri-ya min mɔ gat A-cɛr, la gua̱n Ɣɛ-bɛr kɛnɛ Mal-ki-yel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tɔ̱tɔ̱ kɛ kɛn gaat Dhil-pa ja̱ŋ nyaal ëë ci La-ban ɛ thöp nyaadɛ ni Leya. Ɛ jɛ nɔ pe̱k kuayni Je-kɔb kamädiɛn kɛnɛ Dhil-pa cukɛ a nɛy ti jiath kɛl wi̱cdɛ bäkɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaat ciekdɛ ni Re-cɛl ɛ Jo-thɛp kɛnɛ Ben-ya-min. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A-thɛ-nath, nya Pɔ-ti-pɛ-rä kuäär luaak kuɔth kä Ɔn, ɛn nyam ɛmɔ kɛnɛ Jo-thɛp cukɛ Ma-na-thɛ kɛnɛ Ɛ-pa-rim di̱eth ro̱o̱l I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ben-ya-min a gua̱n Bɛlä, kɛ Bɛ-kɛr, kɛ Ac-bel, kɛ Gerɔ, kɛ Naa-man, kɛ Ɛɛ-ɣi̱, kɛ Röc, kɛ Mu-pim kɛ U-pim kɛnɛ A-rɛd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛ nɔ cu pe̱k kuayni Je-kɔb kamädɛ kɛnɛ Re-cɛl cukɛ a nɛy ti jiath kɛl wi̱cdɛ ŋuaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gatdɛ ni Daan a gua̱n Ɣa-cum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gatdɛ ni Nap-ta-li a gua̱n Ya-dheel, kɛ Guni, kɛ Ye-dhɛr kɛnɛ Ci-lem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tɔ̱tɔ̱ kɛ kɛn gaat Bila, ja̱ŋ nyaal ëë ci La-ban ɛ thöp nyaadɛ ni Re-cɛl. Ɛ jɛ nɔ cu pe̱k kuayni Je-kɔb kamädiɛn kɛnɛ Bila cukɛ a nɛy da̱ŋ bärɔw ɛgi̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mat pe̱k kuayni Je-kɔb tëë wä kɛ jɛ kɛɛl ro̱o̱l I-jëp cukɛ a nɛy ti jiɛn bäkɛl wi̱cdɛ bäkɛl. Ɛn pe̱k ɛmɔ /ca män gankɛ ma̱t thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matdiɛn amäni Jo-thɛp kɛnɛ gaatkɛ da̱ŋ rɛw tëë cɛ di̱eth kä I-jëp cu pe̱k thuɔk duëël Je-kɔb a nɛy ti jiɛn bärɔw ɛgi̱m. Tɔ̱tɔ̱ kɛ kɛn ji̱ thuɔk duëëlɛ tëë ci ben ro̱o̱l I-jëp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Je-kɔb kɛnɛ ji̱ dhɔaarɛ kä I-jëp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
